# SolarEPC-Pro Phase 6: SaaS & Advanced Features

## Goal Description
Transform the platform into a commercial-grade SaaS with performance optimizations, database persistence, advanced hybrid modeling (Diesel/H2), GIS integration, and intelligent automation.

## User Review Required
> [!IMPORTANT]
> **Dependencies**: We need to add `streamlit-folium` and `folium` to [requirements.txt](file:///C:/Users/samsung/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/SolarEPC-Pro/requirements.txt).
> **AI**: We will implement a "Smart Advisor" (Rule-based Expert System) instead of calling external APIs to ensure offline functionality and privacy.
> **Database**: We will use a local SQLite file (`projects.db`) to store project data.

